  "name": "MedRAX2",
  "description": "Updated iteration of the MedRAX agentic chest X-ray reasoning framework from the Bo Wang Lab. Extends the multi-model orchestration approach of MedRAX with improvements to tool integration and reasoning capabilities for complex clinical CXR queries. Early-stage with 25 stars and no releases at time of triage.",
